## Deployment

```bash
# 1. Commit and push locally
git add <files>
git commit -m "Description"
git push origin main

# 2. SSH to server and pull
ssh user@YOUR_SERVER_IP "cd /path/to/app && git pull origin main"

# 3. Rebuild containers if needed
ssh user@YOUR_SERVER_IP "cd /path/to/app && docker compose up -d --build backend"
```

